  "html": "<article id=\"post-5861\" class=\"container post-5861 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-money\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-active-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">Plumbing Services Financing Options with Happy Home Services</h1>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group my-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Happy Home Services, we know that plumbing repairs or upgrades can be unexpected expenses. That’s why we’ve partnered with <strong>Greensky</strong> and <strong>Goodleap </strong>to offer flexible financing options. Whether you’re repairing a burst pipe, replacing a water heater, or upgrading your fixtures, our financing plans help you get the service you need without financial stress. Contact us today to learn more about our financing options for plumbing services.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text full-width-mobile has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Speak with an expert</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(336) 281-9025</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2013\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Photo-of-a-woman-filling-up-a-glass-of-water-from-a-sink-tap.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Photo of a woman filling up a glass of water from a sink tap in Durham, NC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Photo-of-a-woman-filling-up-a-glass-of-water-from-a-sink-tap.jpg 2013w, /images/2024/02/Photo-of-a-woman-filling-up-a-glass-of-water-from-a-sink-tap-300x191.jpg 300w, /images/2024/02/Photo-of-a-woman-filling-up-a-glass-of-water-from-a-sink-tap-1024x651.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/02/Photo-of-a-woman-filling-up-a-glass-of-water-from-a-sink-tap-768x488.jpg 768w, /images/2024/02/Photo-of-a-woman-filling-up-a-glass-of-water-from-a-sink-tap-1536x977.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container pb-5 flow has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-4\">\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer d-block d-md-none\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5\">Affordable Financing for Indoor Air Quality Solutions</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-secondary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\">Plumbing repairs and installations are critical to keeping your home safe and functional. Costs vary depending on the service, with plumbing solutions in Durham, NC, typically ranging from <strong>$200 to $5,000</strong>. From simple repairs to full-system upgrades, our team ensures you get quality service at competitive prices. Contact Happy Home Services today for a free estimate.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group multi-component-container multi-component-container--2-up multi-component-container--uniform-height has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-7 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/ext/2ndwindhvac.com/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Greensky logo\" class=\"wp-image-17\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg 396w, /images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo-300x123.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>No Interest if Paid in Full in 18 Months</strong></strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Subject to credit approval. Minimum monthly payments required. Interest is billed during the promotional period but all interest is waived if the purchase is paid in full within the first 18 months. Making minimum monthly payments will not pay off the entire purchase balance before the end of the promotional period.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://projects.greensky.com/merchantloanapplication?apptype=short&#038;merchant=81086633&#038;dealerplan=2631&#038;channel=External-Button-03\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Greensky</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-8 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/ext/2ndwindhvac.com/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Greensky logo\" class=\"wp-image-17\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg 396w, /images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo-300x123.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Reduced Rate 0% for 6 Months</strong></strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Subject to credit approval. 6 month purchase window. 0.00% interest rate during 6 month promotional period followed by fixed interest rate of 9.99% for 120 months. Payment example assumes one-time $10,000 purchase on approval date (8.9% APR) with 6 months of $0.00 payments followed by 120 amortized payments of $132.10.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://projects.greensky.com/merchantloanapplication?apptype=short&#038;merchant=81086633&#038;dealerplan=1069&#038;channel=External-Button-03\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Greensky</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group multi-component-container multi-component-container--2-up multi-component-container--uniform-height has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-9 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/ext/2ndwindhvac.com/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Greensky logo\" class=\"wp-image-17\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg 396w, /images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo-300x123.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Reduced Rate of 7.99% for 180 Months!</strong></strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Subject to credit approval. Fixed APR of 7.99% for 180 months. Payment example: for $10,000 purchase on approval date, 180 payments of $95.50.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://projects.greensky.com/merchantloanapplication?apptype=short&#038;merchant=81086633&#038;dealerplan=1579&#038;channel=External-Button-03\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Greensky</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-10 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/ext/2ndwindhvac.com/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Greensky logo\" class=\"wp-image-17\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg 396w, /images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo-300x123.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Reduced Rate of 6.99% for 60 Months</strong></strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Subject to credit approval. Fixed APR of 6.99% for 60 months. Payment example: for $10,000 purchase on approval date, 60 payments of $197.96.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://projects.greensky.com/merchantloanapplication?apptype=short&#038;merchant=81086633&#038;dealerplan=2716&#038;channel=External-Button-03\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Greensky</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group multi-component-container multi-component-container--2-up multi-component-container--uniform-height has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-11 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"327\" height=\"95\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Goodleap-Logo-Financial-Provider.jpg\" alt=\"Goodleap logo\" class=\"wp-image-3201\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Goodleap-Logo-Financial-Provider.jpg 327w, /images/2024/02/Goodleap-Logo-Financial-Provider-300x87.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 327px) 100vw, 327px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Monthly Payments to Fit your Budget!</strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Special terms and promotions available. Online account management and bill payment options. View details on the Upgrade site.</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Call Now</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Flexible Financing With our Partners at Greensky and Goodleap</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services partners with trusted financing providers to make your plumbing upgrades accessible and affordable. Here’s what you can expect:</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Monthly Payment Plans:</strong>&nbsp;Customizable plans to fit your budget.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Promotional Rates:</strong>&nbsp;Special terms and reduced interest rates during promotional periods.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Online Account Management:</strong>&nbsp;Track your payments and manage your account conveniently online.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose Happy Home Services?</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services is proud to serve Durham and the surrounding areas with reliable plumbing solutions. Our experienced technicians, combined with flexible financing options through trusted partners, ensure you receive high-quality service at a price you can manage. Let us help you address your plumbing needs today.</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-5861 -->"
